argetProcessGUID: {469f82d3-8b4e-5f52-1f00-000000000400}\r\r\nTargetProcessId: 1336\r\r\nTargetImage: C:\\windows\\system32\\svchost.exe\r\r\nGrantedAccess: 0x1000\r\r\nCallTrace: C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\ntdll.dll+9c534|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\psmserviceexthost.dll+222a3|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\psmserviceexthost.dll+1a172|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\psmserviceexthost.dll+19e3b|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\psmserviceexthost.dll+19318|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\ntdll.dll+3081d|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\ntdll.dll+345b4|C:\\windows\\System32\\KERNEL32.DLL+17bd4|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\ntdll.dll+6ce51\r\nEvent: evt-00006 | Host: WS-06.corp.example\r\n  event_id: evt-00006\r\n  timestamp: 2026-05-06T00:00:00.001Z\r\n  event_code: 10\r\n  channel: Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational\r\n  provider: Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon\r\n  host: WS-06.corp.example\r\n  image: C:\\windows\\system32\\svchost.exe\r\n  target_image: C:\\windows\\system32\\svchost.exe\r\n  granted_access: 0x1000\r\n  process_guid: {469f82d3-8b4c-5f52-0e00-000000000400}\r\n  message: Process accessed:\r\r\nRuleName: -\r\r\nUtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:40.043\r\r\nSourceProcessGUID: {469f82d3-8b4c-5f52-0e00-000000000400}\r\r\nSourceProcessId: 868\r\r\nSourceThreadId: 448\r\r\nSourceImage: C:\\windows\\system32\\svchost.exe\r\r\nTargetProcessGUID: {469f82d3-8b4e-5f52-1f00-000000000400}\r\r\nTargetProcessId: 1336\r\r\nTargetImage: C:\\windows\\system32\\svchost.exe\r\r\nGrantedAccess: 0x1000\r\r\nCallTrace: C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\ntdll.dll+9c534|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\psmserviceexthost.dll+222a3|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\psmserviceexthost.dll+1a172|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\psmserviceexthost.dll+19e3b|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\psmserviceexthost.dll+19318|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\ntdll.dll+3081d|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\ntdll.dll+345b4|C:\\windows\\System32\\KERNEL32.DLL+17bd4|C:\\windows\\SYSTEM32\\ntdll.dll+6ce51\r\n"]
