it Event: evt-01610 | Code: 4656 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01611 | Code: 4663 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01612 | Code: 4658 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01613 | Code: 4690 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01614 | Code: 4658 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01615 | Code: 4656 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01616 | Code: 4663 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01617 | Code: 4658 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01618 | Code: 4690 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01619 | Code: 4658 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01620 | Code: 4656 | PID: 0x90c\r\nMalicious Audit Event: evt-01621 | Code: 4658 | PID: 0x90c\r\n"]
