[264.161863, "o", "Total Classified Malicious: 1046\r\nRemaining: 1021\r\n=== Remaining events on WS-05 ===\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:00.000Z | evt-00001 | Code: 5158 | Img:  | Msg: The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a bind to a local port.\r\r\n\r\r\nApplication Information:\r\r\n\tP\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:00.000Z | evt-00002 | Code: 5156 | Img:  | Msg: The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a connection.\r\r\n\r\r\nApplication Information:\r\r\n\tProcess ID:\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:00.000Z | evt-00003 | Code: 11 | Img: C:\\windows\\System32\\svchost.exe | Msg: File created:\r\r\nRuleName: -\r\r\nUtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:38.962\r\r\nProcessGuid: {860ba2e3-8b50-5f52-1e00-\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:15.094Z | evt-00053 | Code: 5158 | Img:  | Msg: The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a bind to a local port.\r\r\n\r\r\nApplication Information:\r\r\n\tP\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:15.094Z | evt-00054 | Code: 5156 | Img:  | Msg: The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a connection.\r\r\n\r\r\nApplication Information:\r\r\n\tProcess ID:\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:15.095Z | evt-00055 | Code: 12 | Img: C:\\windows\\Explorer.EXE | Msg: Registry object added or deleted:\r\r\nRuleName: -\r\r\nEventType: CreateKey\r\r\nUtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:54.9\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:15.095Z | evt-00056 | Code: 13 | Img: C:\\windows\\Explorer.EXE | Msg: Registry value set:\r\r\nRuleName: -\r\r\nEventType: SetValue\r\r\nUtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:54.970\r\r\nProcessGuid\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:15.096Z | evt-00057 | Code: 10 | Img: C:\\windows\\system32\\svchost.exe | Msg: Process accessed:\r\r\nRuleName: -\r\r\nUtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:54.970\r\r\nSourceProcessGUID: {860ba2e3-8b64-"]
